Terminal_04 =
"\cDYou see a dim light amidst the viscera. A cracked, but apparently very sturdy tablet has this message, no date:\n\n"
"\cU''The thing has their faces. Even my wife's. I've locked myself in this giant room. It makes no sense. Their vitals... Are they alive in there? The next "
"expedition needs to know. I've prepared a data burst with all I've seen.";
Terminal_04a = "\cD[Press the 'Send' button]";
Terminal_04b = "\cD[Press the 'Delete' button]";
Terminal_04x =
"\cDYou press the button. A progress bar fills, and the screen turns off as soon as it's finished.";
Terminal_05d = "\cD[Check logs]";
Terminal_05d_1 =
"\cDFrom: \cFReconnaissance Team Alpha 4\n\n"
"\cJOur initial incursion into the zone uncovered what appeared to be a complex filtration system, constantly detoxing and pumping blood. Brother Samson attempted "
"to open the maintenance panel, but after the identity verification ripped his arm off we decided to cut our losses and retreat for the time being.\n\n"
"Recommend that the next infiltration team recover the remains of Brother Samson.\n"
"	-Senior Brother Wyatt\n\n"
"PS: Send Brother Samson's last payment to his widow.";
