Terminal_07a_1 =
"\cDFrom: \cFReconnaissance Team Alpha 6\n\n"
"\cDThe specimen\cJ is extremely vulnerable to a sudden and overwhelming barrage of proxemic stimulus. This is supported by "
"direct on-field observation with a live subject, thanks to Sister Julia engaging with it using her service \cDshotgun\cJ.\n\n"
"However, I'm afraid that Brother Sigmund has suffered deep and irreversible psychological trauma. His ramblings "
"about blood sacrifices, archetypal possessions and a ''descent into infinity inside the eternal maze'' "
"are disturbing enough to unnerve the team. After administering psychoactive drugs as an emergency measure, "
"he is now reduced to muttering variations on ''they are us''. He has been deemed combat ineffective.\n\n"
"Contact Master Raah as soon as possible.";
