Terminal_11a = "\cD[Check logs]";
Terminal_11a_1 =
"\cU[Log 1/4] Nov. 1, 8:45 PM\n\n"
"Today, our radio equipment picked up an odd low frequency transmission (7-12hz) emanating near the courtyard. Now, these readings aren't unusual, "
"as nearby activities from wildlife, humans and vehicles are known to cause a stir every now and then.\n\n"
"What was weird though was the consistency of the signal. It just continues to transmit without fluctuation.";
Terminal_11a_2 =
"\cU[Log 2/4] Nov. 4, 3:33 PM\n\n"
"Upon further investigation, all evidence points to the signal coming from somewhere below. But no foundational blueprints or geological records "
"indicate any structure being built that far down. Once The Noble Ones received our full report, they ordered an immediate excavation into the depths, "
"believing that the sacred resonance was inviting them to its presence.";
Terminal_11a_3 =
"\cU[Log 3/4] Jan. 10, 11:02 AM\n\n"
"It's been weeks of digging into solid earth. Most of the workers are exhausted -- and their faith appears to be "
"faltering before my eyes.\n\n"
"However, that notion cleared up quickly when the drilling equipment struck through solid concrete. On the other side lies a perfectly squared - "
"four-sided room, draped in all white tiles. The place looked like it hadn't been touched in centuries, yet somehow also appearing unnaturally clean. "
"Not even a spec of dust.";
Terminal_11a_4 =
"\cU[Log 4/4] Jan. 18, 3:21 AM\n\n"
"A proper elevator lift was quickly constructed and teams were sent in to search for the signal. It's been confirmed beyond any reasonable doubt "
"that the strange frequency emission was coming from the room.\n\n"
"The first team never came back up.\n\n"
"A second team was sent in after with live communication and camera feeds. When they reached the bottom of the lift, all connections ceased. "
"Determined to seek an answer, one of The Nobles requested to investigate the matter by themselves, we are preparing for their descent tonight.";
Terminal_12a = "\cD[Enable: Excavation Lift]";
