Terminal_12_b1 =
"\cDBreathing ice cubes sailing down the clock will park on the sky. The boxes are organizing themselves. "
"Rejoice! A snake spiraled from high pitched lights. Very satisfactory mail answer to interconnected vibrations "
"inside our circle worlds. Eyes and ears will be on the menu now during the evening, good morning!\n\n"
"Doors into paradise has been revealed.";
