Alien_01 =
"\cDYou are floating millions of miles above, in an enormous white hall that seems to go on forever. There are no landmarks to indicate the beginning or "
"end of it all---only a continuous, uninterrupted flow of space.\n\n"
"The air is silent, and stillness is woven into the fabric of your surroundings. The only thing that appears to be in motion is you.";
Alien_01a = "\cDLook around.";
Alien_02 =
"\cDBefore you even realize it, a massive glass dome appears before you, suspended in the air. Inside the dome, \na single, enormous eye focuses on you. "
"Its iris swirls with an otherworldly pattern and color, shifting like a whirlpool in motion. The eye blinks once, then begins to inspect you...\n\n"
"\cFIn an instant, you are miraculously cured of all your ailments. It feels as though they never existed. You feel \na surge of vitality spread through every "
"fiber of your being, revitalizing you in ways you cannot fully comprehend. The eye, still locked onto you, blinks once more, and the world around you begins "
"to brighten. \nA strange warmth washes over you as you are gently sent back home, with a gift now appearing in your inventory, as if it had always been meant "
"for you.";
Alien_02a = "\cDOpen your eyes.";
Bed_02a = "\cDThat is not possible at the moment.";
Buried_Entrance01 =
"\cDThe doors in front of you will automatically lock as you pass into the next area."
