FileCab03 =
"File Reference: \cFOTRP-1145\cJ\n"
"Clearance Level: \cFClassified\cJ\n"
"Date: \cD[REDACTED]\cJ\n"
"Submitted by: \cD[REDACTED]\cJ\n"
"Location: \cD[REDACTED]\cJ\n\n"
"TRANSCRIPT:\n\n"
"Yeah, apprehension of the fanatics went well. They are scheduled for transfer and processing at \cD[REDACTED]\cJ at dawn. Despite prior intel warning "
"us that they were pretty much animals, this group was unnervingly calm and rational. Upon detainment, several of them were reported to smile, not those "
"crazy smiles you can see in the bitches from the surface, actual smiles, and even willingly offered themselves to be cuffed. They were chanting softly "
"as the round-up was completed.\n\n"
"No, no. Not screaming, chanting.\n\n"
"How the fuck would I know? Something like 'Sarmi' whatever... Yeah. No, I don't...\n\n"
"\cD-The rest of the files are blank.-";
FileCab05 =
"\cF<Start of recovered segment>\cJ\n"
"\cDMcKenna:\cJ And this Raah. What did it look like?\n"
"\cDAnderson:\cJ It is... made up of pure consciousness. It isn't malicious nor benevolent. More like a jester of sort.\n"
"\cDMcKenna:\cJ Did you have any interactions with the described entity?\n"
"\cDAnderson:\cJ It... sang to me. The vibrations, the... pulse, the rhythms! They were as much of it as it is an expression of them.\n"
"\cDMcKenna:\cJ Could you elaborate on what you meant?\n"
"\cDAnderson:\cJ I-I'm sorry... It is difficult to put into words. All I know is that it felt right. Felt true, truer than anything I've ever experienced in my life. I dunno- like REALER than real.\n" 
"\cDMcKenna:\cJ And did it show you... anything? A vision -- or some sort of imagery -- projection?\n"
"\cDAnderson:\cJ Yes. It did. It showed me a vision of an endless maze beneath a black sun. Under the maze lies this great inverted white pyramid. Ther-\n"
"\cDMcKenna:\cJ Thank you, Phillip. We'll get back to you in a second.\n"
"\cDHofmann:\cJ I'm telling you, Edna. It knows, it's clearly been observing us.\n"
"\cDMcKenna:\cJ Relax, we've got plenty of safeties in place. The neural inhibitors, DASDs, isolation tanks.\n"
"\cF<End of recovered segment>";
FileCab09 =
"\cF[RECOVERED FRAGMENT - PHANTOM REALM EXPEDITION 3]\n"
"\cJI saw the \cDcerulean night\cJ dancing around its axis, welcoming its observers to gaze upon the captivating ambient "
"of the \cDstars\cJ. And at once, the \cDcrimson sky\cJ is called forth, transforming into a brilliant expression of noumenal "
"certainty in its descension.\n\n"
"It is there that I saw it. The luminous golden rays that may at one point or another belonged to-";
