Six_Log1 = "\cU[Log 1/8]\n\nDay 1:\n"
"Construction of the massive anechoic chamber has begun. All budget, permits, inspections, documents and other preparations are satisfied. "
"I have not been told what the purpose of such a room entails, only that the higher-ups needed it done urgently.";
Six_Log2 = "\cU[Log 2/8]\n\nDay 7:\n"
"Today, a senior researcher was detained on the work site. He was shouting cryptic remarks about the Titan Outpost while they dragged him away, "
"something about organic blueprints and demanding to know why they ate the messiah. Poor guy, he just needs some sleep.";
Six_Log3 = "\cU[Log 3/8]\n\nDay 23:\n"
"Feeling more tired than usual. Seems like I'm not the only one, a lot of the other guys are feeling it as well. Everyone just seems less talkative "
"lately. Progress is still going well though.";
Six_Log4 = "\cU[Log 4/8]\n\nDay 30:\n"
"Apparently the shareholders visited today. I couldn't care less, my head's been aching for the last two days and I just want to sleep.";
Six_Log5 = "\cU[Log 5/8]\n\nDay 44:\n"
"I've been having very bad dreams. Each time before waking I find myself standing inside the pitch black chamber. Constructions are nearly over. "
"I need a change in department.";
Six_Log6 = "\cU[Log 6/8]\n\nDay 75:\n"
"Tired. Just want to go home. please. Don't let them .i";
